     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Is there an R package that can do simultaneous regression equations such that I can determine how well each IV predicts each DV (classic &quot;horizontal&quot; comparisons) and that allows me to assess each IVs differential influence on each DV (&quot;vertical&quot; comparisons)?<div><br></div><div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"845\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:845pt\">\n\n <colgroup><col width=\"65\" span=\"13\" style=\"width:65pt\">\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"195\" style=\"height:15.0pt;width:195pt\"><u>Simultaneous regression Equations:</u></td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"></td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"></td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"></td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"></td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"></td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"></td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"></td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"></td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"></td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">DVs</td>\n  <td>Modifying IV</td>\n  <td>IV</td>\n  <td>IV</td>\n  <td>IV</td>\n  <td>IV</td>\n  <td>IV</td>\n  <td>IV</td>\n  <td>IV</td>\n  <td>IV</td>\n  <td>IV</td>\n  <td>IV</td>\n  <td>IV</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">RT</td>\n  <td>x1</td>\n  <td>F1</td>\n  <td>F2</td>\n  <td>F3</td>\n  <td>S1</td>\n  <td>S2</td>\n  <td>S3</td>\n  <td>E1</td>\n  <td>E2</td>\n  <td>E3</td>\n  <td>E4</td>\n  <td>E5</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">Error rate 1</td>\n  <td>x2</td>\n  <td>F1</td>\n  <td>F2</td>\n  <td>F3</td>\n  <td>S1</td>\n  <td>S2</td>\n  <td>S3</td>\n  <td>E1</td>\n  <td>E2</td>\n  <td>E3</td>\n  <td>E4</td>\n  <td>E5</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">Error rate 2</td>\n  <td>x3</td>\n  <td>F1</td>\n  <td>F2</td>\n  <td>F3</td>\n  <td>S1</td>\n  <td>S2</td>\n  <td>S3</td>\n  <td>E1</td>\n  <td>E2</td>\n  <td>E3</td>\n  <td>E4</td>\n  <td>E5</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">Error rate 3</td>\n  <td>x4</td>\n  <td>F1</td>\n  <td>F2</td>\n  <td>F3</td>\n  <td>S1</td>\n  <td>S2</td>\n  <td>S3</td>\n  <td>E1</td>\n  <td>E2</td>\n  <td>E3</td>\n  <td>E4</td>\n  <td>E5</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">Error rate 4</td>\n  <td>x5</td>\n  <td>F1</td>\n  <td>F2</td>\n  <td>F3</td>\n  <td>S1</td>\n  <td>S2</td>\n  <td>S3</td>\n  <td>E1</td>\n  <td>E2</td>\n  <td>E3</td>\n  <td>E4</td>\n  <td>E5</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">Error rate 5</td>\n  <td>x6</td>\n  <td>F1</td>\n  <td>F2</td>\n  <td>F3</td>\n  <td>S1</td>\n  <td>S2</td>\n  <td>S3</td>\n  <td>E1</td>\n  <td>E2</td>\n  <td>E3</td>\n  <td>E4</td>\n  <td>E5</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\"></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\"></td>\n  <td>Q1</td>\n  <td colspan=\"4\">How well does each IV\n  predict each DV?</td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\"></td>\n  <td>Q2</td>\n  <td colspan=\"9\">What is the differential\n  influence of each IV on Each DV (e.g., Does IV E2 predict Error rate 3 better\n  than Error rate 4)?</td>\n  <td></td>\n  <td></td>\n </tr>\n\n</tbody></table><div><br></div><div><u>Information about my data:</u></div><div><br></div><div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"130\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:130pt\">\n\n <colgroup><col width=\"65\" span=\"2\" style=\"width:65pt\">\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" width=\"65\" style=\"height:15.0pt;width:65pt\"><b>DV</b></td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"><b>Type</b></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">RT</td>\n  <td>continuous</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">Error rate 1</td>\n  <td>proportion</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">Error rate 2</td>\n  <td>proportion</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">Error rate 3</td>\n  <td>proportion</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">Error rate 4</td>\n  <td>proportion</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">Error rate 5</td>\n  <td>proportion</td>\n </tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"195\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:195pt\">\n\n <colgroup><col width=\"65\" span=\"3\" style=\"width:65pt\">\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" colspan=\"3\" width=\"195\" style=\"height:15.0pt;width:195pt\">* Note that Error rates 2-5 are mutually exclusive subsets of\n  error rate 1</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\"></td>\n  <td>Error rate 1</td>\n  <td>Overall error rate</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\"></td>\n  <td>Error rate 2</td>\n  <td>Rate of error type A</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\"></td>\n  <td>Error rate 3</td>\n  <td>Rate of error type B</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\"></td>\n  <td>Error rate 4</td>\n  <td>Rate of error type C</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\"></td>\n  <td>Error rate 5</td>\n  <td>Rate of error type D</td>\n </tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"195\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:195pt\">\n\n <colgroup><col width=\"65\" span=\"3\" style=\"width:65pt\">\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" width=\"65\" style=\"height:15.0pt;width:65pt\"><b>IV</b></td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"><b>Type</b></td>\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">x1</td>\n  <td>count</td>\n  <td><b><i>modifier</i></b></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">F1</td>\n  <td>continuous</td>\n  <td></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">F2</td>\n  <td>continuous</td>\n  <td></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">F3</td>\n  <td>continuous</td>\n  <td></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">S1</td>\n  <td>ratio</td>\n  <td></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">S2</td>\n  <td>count</td>\n  <td></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">S3</td>\n  <td>count</td>\n  <td></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">E1</td>\n  <td>count</td>\n  <td></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">E2</td>\n  <td>count</td>\n  <td></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">E3</td>\n  <td>count</td>\n  <td></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">E4</td>\n  <td>count</td>\n  <td></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">E5</td>\n  <td>continuous</td>\n  <td><br></td>\n </tr>\n\n</tbody></table><br><br>** Note that all distributions - both DVs and IVs are non-normal**<br><br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"130\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:130pt\">\n\n <colgroup><col width=\"65\" span=\"2\" style=\"width:65pt\">\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"130\" style=\"height:15.0pt;width:130pt\"><u>Correlations between IVs and modifier</u></td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\"></td>\n  <td>x1</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">F1</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">-0.340</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">F2</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">0.705</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">F3</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">0.917</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">S1</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">0.882</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">S2</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">0.634</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">S3</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">0.694</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">E1</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">0.744</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">E2</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">0.638</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">E3</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">0.244</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">E4</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">0.228</td>\n </tr>\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\n  <td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">E5</td>\n  <td align=\"right\">0.899</td>\n </tr>\n\n</tbody></table><div><br></div><div>If R cannot do this analysis but Mplus can, can someone please explain what it is about Mplus that allows it to do what R cannot?</div></div></div></div>"
